AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002578> "p directly regulates q iff p is immediately causally upstream of q and p regulates q.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002578> "directly regulates")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002578> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002211>)
