AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002597> "Holds between c and p if and only if c is capable of some activity a, and a negatively regulates p.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002597> "capable of negatively regulating")
